Meeting


INTRO TO THE DESIGN SYSTEM

When

2026-02-18 · 15:00–16:00 UTC

Where

Room 2A — or join on the call

Join

Join the meeting https://example.com/call/design-system

A one-hour intro for anyone building UI. We'll walk through the component library, then build a screen together so you leave knowing how the pieces fit.


WHO IT'S FOR

 * Engineers and designers new to the system
 * Anyone copying old markup who wants the supported way

> Bring a laptop. The recording and notes go out to all attendees.


MEET THE HOSTS

Jordan Lee

Design Systems Lead

Leads the component library and helps product teams turn shared design patterns into accessible interfaces.


AGENDA

15:00

Tokens, components, and when to use which

15:30

Hands-on: build a screen from the kit

15:50

Q&A

